```Title: Script File Opened from Downloads, Temp or Outlook Attachments (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1204.002 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 5e7dd240-866c-4ae0-a151-a3796bc5e746```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Installers and login scripts that run VBScript from a temporary folder```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(Image IN ("*\\wscript.exe", "*\\cscript.exe", "*\\mshta.exe") CommandLine IN ("*\\Downloads\\*", "*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\*", "*\\Content.Outlook\\*", "*\\INetCache\\*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
